#import "/.shared/typst/utp.typ": *

#labquestion(1)[Map the actual handoff][
  Draw lanes for Hiring Manager, HR and Candidate. Place vacancy approval, screening, interview, selection and offer in the responsible lane. Connect an output document or status to each next owner.
]

#labanswer[
  #strong[Inspect the result.] Every transition has a sender, recipient and information item. A lane label alone does not explain a handoff.
]

#labquestion(2)[Add both decision outcomes][
  After screening, draw a Yes path to interview and a No path to a rejection notification. After the offer, show acceptance and decline. Include the final owner for each outcome.
]

#labanswer[
  #strong[Inspect the result.] All branches reach a clear end or a named rework step; no rejected candidate disappears from the process.
]
